.DS_Store
.claude/skills/open-knowledge/
.cursor/skills/open-knowledge/
.codex/skills/open-knowledge/
.github/skills/open-knowledge/
.opencode/skills/open-knowledge/
.pi/skills/open-knowledge/

# The `open-knowledge` skill is machine-installed and refreshes from upstream,
# so it stays out of version control. The `okf-knowledge-base` skill IS
# committed on purpose: it is the Open Knowledge Format contract this example
# demonstrates, and cloners should get it without a separate install step.

# Per-machine editor state. Contains the MCP pre-approval; committing it would
# remove the approval prompt for everyone who clones this repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.cursor/settings.local.json

# Common footguns. Nothing here is used by this wiki, but the repository is
# published as an example others clone and build on.
.env
.env.*
node_modules/
